window.products.push({"id":788095,"name":"Hello Door Wreath, Boxwood Wreath 24inch, 24'' Farmhouse Eucalyptus Flocked Lambs Ear Wreath for Front Door Hanging Wall Window Party Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tB0tAUU0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Front Door Wreath. The boxwood wreath works as indoor wreath, outdoor wreath, wedding wreath, welcome wreath, etc. It’s also suitable for sitting room, hotel, wedding scene, window, villa and wall decoration, photography background, etc. This Green wreath will bring an enjoyable ambiance all year round. Handmade Greenery Wreath. This artificial eucalyptus wreath for front door is made by hand. The eucalyptus leaves are made of silk cloth, and the boxwood, cypress, birch, lambs ear leaves are made of plastic. The back of the wreath is a natural grapevine wreath with built-in hook for easy hanging. The hello sign can be removed from the wreath. Spring Summer Wreath Size and Material. The front door wreath is 24'' and made from quality plastic and cloth, waterproof and UV protection, no maintenance, no trimming. Wipe clean with a soft damp cloth if needed. Works once you take it out of the box. You only need to adjust leaves to get a vivid appearance. Maintenance-Free. Artificial green leaves wreath always stays color and shape, and will look great for years to come. You can blow it with a hair dryer to make the wreath as bright as new. Suggest indoor use. If works outdoor, please try to avoid rain and snow. Note. Because the door wreath may be squeezed during transportation, they need to be re-shaped once removed from the box, to achieve their intended appearance and size. It is recommended to use after ventilation. Please don't hesitate to tell us if you have any concerns, and we will slove it in your favor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tB0tAUU0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEVENLOVE","source_asin":"B0B1HSG9M7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1HSG9M7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1HSG9M7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
