window.products.push({"id":788103,"name":"Simple&Opulence 100% Linen Sheet Set with Embroidery Washed - 4 Pieces (1 Flat Sheet & 1 Fitted Sheet & 2 Pillowcases) Natural Flax Soft Bedding Breat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pJ6pk2MXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"QUEEN SIZE — 1 x Flat Sheet: 90\" x 102\", 1 x Fitted Sheet: 60\" x 80\" x 14\", 2 x Pillowcases: 20\" x 30\". Applied in a variety of occasions and uses: Your sweet home, guest room, anniversary/ wedding / thanksgiving/ christmas gift/ present for your parent/ children/ relatives or your friends. MATERIAL — Made of 100% Premium Quality French Flax Fabric with Pre Washed, 160 GSM (For making the fabric soft, the pre-washing process will cause an uncontrollable shrinkage, so the final GSM will have 5% more or less deviation). Use the exquisite craftsmanship stitch with the elegant embroidery on the sheet and pillowcase. Our linen products has been certified according to STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX, which is eco-friendly. ADVANTAGE — Unique breathable, cool feeling in summer, no sweating concern; Also a great choice for winter, wonderfully warm. Heat conduction and moisture absorption is larger than cotton fabric, you will get great night's sleep.The flax sheets can bring you a healthier life, durable for a long period. Good color fastness, not easy to fade. This linen sheet set will exceed all of your needs. USE INSTRUCTION — Gentle cycle washing under 60℃. Do not use detergent that contains bleach or whitener. Tumble dry with medium heat. Warm ironing if needed. Do not dry clean. Wash with similar colors. Linen fabric will become softer after every wash. 4 Pieces Sheet Set — Including 1 Flat Sheet 1 Fitted Sheet and 2 Pillowcases, Mattress Cover is Deep Pocket design, the depth of the fitted sheet is about 14 inch. The elastic is all around the fitted sheet. ◆TIPS—The matched style duvet cover set/fitted sheet/pillowcases are available, you can find their image options at the bottom of the description, they are perfect match!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pJ6pk2MXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simple&Opulence","source_asin":"B0B2JYZWBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2JYZWBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2JYZWBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
