window.products.push({"id":788170,"name":"10 Pack Reusable Storage Bags (4 Reusable Sandwich Bags, 6 Reusable Snack Bags), Extra Thick Leakproof Silicone and Plastic Free Ziplock Lunch Bags Fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UCsXtE3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD GRADE MATERIAL: Jjyee reusable sandwich bags are made of food-grade & eco-friendly PEVA material, PVC-free, lead-free, chloride-free, an eco-friendly and recyclable material that is not harmful to the environment when disposed of or burned. These reusable food bags are environmentally friendly, healthy and safe product. DURABLE & ECO-FRIENDLY: Our food storage bags have been thickened and can be reused hundred times, 10 pack set is enough for family use and will save you thousands of disposable baggies, perfect solution for plastic bags waste reduction and Eco-friendly. LEAKPROOF & EASY SEAL: Upgraded double ziplock closures ensure an airtight leakproof seal, perfect for storing and preserving food. With upgraded widened side and non-slip zipper design, children can easily open and close the snack bags. PERFECT SIZES & MULTI-PURPOSE:The size of this sandwich container is 8.46*7.09 inch, snack bag is 8.46*4.73 inch. Perfect container for snacks, lunch, vegetables, fruits, cosmetics, jewelry, make-up, stationery, travel and more. EASY TO CLEAN: Easily hand wash in cold or room temperature water and air dry to clean. Since the temperature range of food grade PEVA is - 94 ℉ to 104℉, please DON'T use boiling water. These reusable ziploc bags freezer safe and not microwave or dishwasher friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UCsXtE3jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jjyee","source_asin":"B07WSZ299Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WSZ299Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WSZ299Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
