window.products.push({"id":788396,"name":"Super Soft Faux Fur Rug Shaggy Fluffy Faux Sheepskin Rugs for Bedroom Kid's Room White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ig0tSrRSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"When you are at home, you can be really yourself. When you are at home, you can leave any trouble outside. When you are at home,you can laugh for anything you want to enjoy. if you are someone who enjoys life,and we are sure that you must have a home with a delicate decoration,the rug is definitely for you. Choose/custom the right size For the size you are gonna purchase is fit,please measure your floor before you place an order.and if you want to customize the size,please contact us for a quote. Safety Material Made from 100% artificial materials,no harm,chemicals or allergen,when you are lying on it,or your child is playing on it,totally safe. Usage [Protection] :The rug will protect your wood or tile floor,Slow down the wear,absort water,mud,sand,and dust,keep cleaning. [Kid plaing mat] :Your kid always like to run around barefoot on the floor,or sit on the floor and play with their toys.If there is a soft and nice rug to protect them, will you be more at ease. [Cover/Pad] :put it to beside of the warm fireplace,sofa,chair,living room,or throw it on the couch for naps,extra warmth. [Home decor] :Home carpet is relatively affordable,high grade products.Representing the different styles of modern furniture in solid colors. Cleaning Instruction To clean the dust,you can use vacuum cleaner or soft brush to sweep along the fur,or you can wash it by hand or wipe clean,then place it in the sun. It will be back to work soon. WARNING:DO NOT WASH THE RUG BY MACHINE and other chemicals, which may corrosion and fade the rugs. Sweet Tips Please allow 2-3CM error from different measurement method. Due to the different displays, it causes a slight color difference,which is normal. Long-time Storage and Fold pack,the rug will be creased.whici is normal,just let it lay flat on the ground.it will work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ig0tSrRSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Exquisite home","source_asin":"B07DCBXQJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DCBXQJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DCBXQJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
