window.products.push({"id":788437,"name":"3pcs 304 Stainless Steel Kitchen tool set. Kitchen Scissors, Fish Scale Remover, Shrimp Line Knife,All purpose Scissors Shears,Fish Cleaning Tools ,Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mJxCejGbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality and Multi-purpose】 The Heavy Duty Kitchen Scissors kitchen shear blades are made from Japanese high-carbon SK5 stainless steel.The Fish Scale Remover and Shrimp Line Knife are made of food grade non-toxic 304 Stainless Steel, They are rust-resistance, durable and long lasting on quality.The Barbecue Scissors,the Fish Scaler and the Shrimp Opener’s blades are crafted from high quality Ultra Sharp Stainless Steel, The BBQ Scissors can capable of various kitchen tasks. The Fish Scale Remover can easily remove scale from fish. The Shrimp Deveiner Tool very suitable for all kinds of seafood.The 3 Kitchen tools used together to make the kitchen work easier. 【Multi Function Kitchen Shears】The kitchen shear is made of stainless steel SK5, making them sharper, rust-proof and corrosion-resistant. The kitchen scissors perform well in all major kitchen tasks, such as cut chicken/poultry, meat, vegetables, fresh fruits, herbs, chocolate, and even string, packaging and flower stems. You may use it for outside tasks like pruning rose bushes, trimming branches, cutting cardboard, paper, and hard plastic. Aluminum alloy comfortable non-slip handle ensure added stability and convenience with your grip, to fit your left and right hands perfectly. Additional bottle opener let you open bottles and jars quickly. 【Scales Peeler】The Fish descaler tool suit for all fish with large or fine scales,such as Salmon, Sea Bass, Sardine and more. Sawtooth design makes this fish scaler very efficient and simple to scraping scales and no spoil the fish skin and the double row serration can quickly remove fish scales.The discharge mouth avoid scale accumulation. fish scraper is lightweight, long-lasting, and will not break easily. 【 Shrimp Line Knife】The shrimp line knife is perfect for preparing seafood, fish, etc. Quickly and perfectly peel prawns, open fish maw, remove fish scales. The barb serrated design, so that the shrimp line in the groove will not slip, easy to pick out 【Easy to clean and store】All 3 Kitchen tools are dishwasher safe.The surfaces of these three Kitchen clipper, Fish Scaler Remover and Shrimp Line Knife are finely polished, which is very easy to clean after use.The handles are ergonomic , comfortable and effortless as while using.The tail hanging hole design is convenient for hanging and storage, does not take up space, and is easy to take and place . The convenient set is also suitable for restaurants, seafood markets,fish sales, fish processing plants, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mJxCejGbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUASUNWAY","source_asin":"B0BP3KTFGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP3KTFGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP3KTFGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":788438,"name":"Gaia Wings 100 Movies Scratch Off Poster includes Poster Frame 17\" Long (Black) - The Perfect Movie Room Decor, Wall Art or Gift for Film Buffs - Easy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O74aZA3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DELIGHTFULLY EASY TO SCRATCH: Tired of hearing the dreaded “You pick something” on movie night? Spice things up with a scratchable must-see movie poster that always keeps things fun and fresh by uncovering a brand new movie to watch under easy-to-scratch foil (scratching tool included). We even made it easy to just scratch the title area in case you want to pick a specific movie instead of making it a mystery! BUILT-IN STAR RATING SYSTEM: Other 100 movies scratch off posters only reveal your mystery movie when scratched. The Gaia Wings scratch-off poster has a built-in star rating system so you can channel your inner film critic and show the world just what you think about titles you’ve watched. Just scratch the stars to rate each flick! Our poster also includes handy bonus information about your mystery movies, like who directed it and what year it was made. INCLUDES WOODEN POSTER FRAME: Your 100 movies bucket list comes with its very own black movie poster frame, so it’s ready to hang straight out of the box. It’s made with super high-quality wood and built to last (no cheap materials, here!). Plus, you’ll never have to worry about shopping around trying to find a frame that fits. Just pop the poster into the top of the frame and it’s ready to hang on any wall, anywhere! BEAUTIFUL, READY-TO-GIFT PACKAGING: Looking for movie buff gifts to excite a film lover in your life? Our scratch-off poster comes pre-packaged in a beautiful box, so it’s 100% ready to gift when ordering – you don’t even need wrapping paper! Or get it for the whole family and make Mystery Movie Night a weekly event. With numbered boxes for each flick, it’s easy to use someone’s birthday or draw numbers from a jar to get everyone in on the fun! INSTANTLY LIVENS UP ANY SPACE: Proudly show off your movie-watching accomplishments in any room of the house with an iconic movies poster that matches almost any color scheme. Great as wall decor for bare rooms that need a little livening up and makes a fantastic conversation piece when guests are over!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O74aZA3mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gaia Wings","source_asin":"B07SVHG2ZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SVHG2ZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SVHG2ZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
