window.products.push({"id":788445,"name":"Esright Recliner Chair with Massage Heated Function, Modern Fabric Lounge Chair with Side Pocket,2 Seat Sofa Living Room Chair (Coffee)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VwM-cK1vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EXTRA COMFORTABLE】This recliner massage chair offers unparalleled comfort. Wide headrest with cushion for leaning on, can reduce your back pressure; You could pull the buckle on the two sides to eject the footrest. So you could stretch your body and eliminate the fatigue of the day. 【MASSAGE & HEATED FUNCTION 】This lounge recliner chair has the vibration massage function. 8 point Massage, 2 different vibration intensity, 5 modes adjustment. The heating function can further promote blood circulation during massage. 【140° FLEXIBLE RECLINING】 This 2 seat sofa chair has many practical functions. It can lie down at 140 degrees, which can effectively reduce the pressure on your back.When you turn on the footrest, lower your back, turn on these functions, and enjoy this comfortable time that only belongs to you. 【ATTENTIVE DESIGN】Our living room chair has 2 side pockets, which can be enough for you to place your remote control, mobile phone, ipad, and books to free your hands. So you can enjoy your time with ease.Product Size:49-1/2\"(L) x 28\"(W) x 39-3/8\"(H). Weight Capacity: 400 lbs. 【ASSEMBLY & WARRANTY】No screw needed,just take you few minutes,very easy to assemble. All most you need to do is insert the backrest into a special groove to install the body. If you have any question,please contact us. We'd like to help you to solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VwM-cK1vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esright","source_asin":"B08JYGKKMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYGKKMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYGKKMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":788446,"name":"Amalfi Decor 2-Piece Glass Metal Candelabra Set, Single 1-Light Votive Candle Taper Candlestick Holder Unity Accent Stand (Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ec7iYIV-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ornate and gorgeous at every angle, this Madeleine Collection antique silver candelabra 2-piece set is bursting with stunning details. From the dazzling crystal dangles to the elegant finishing, this candle holder set will transform weddings, events, birthdays, Quinceaneras, baby showers, and any special occasions into a full-blown celebration. This set also works easily as centerpieces or to add as decorative accents to end tables or side tables in your home or office. Each of the 2 candelabras stands at 16 inches tall and 7 inches wide. If you are looking for a nice gift for your friends and family, this set makes a great housewarming and wedding gift that will surely impress. The unique design features a single detachable clear glass tealight votive holder on each candelabra (2 total), which allows you to switch between holding tealight candles or taper dinner candlesticks within a matter of seconds. This also helps with cleaning, transporting, and handling the candelabras. This candelabra set is hand-crafted in a steel metal frame and accented with authentic glass crystal pendants and beads that perfectly complements the candlelight. The bases are weighted and come with non-slip felted bottoms to ensure sturdiness when displaying, so you do not have to worry about them toppling over easily. The frames are painted with a silver color, and finished with antique-style brush strokes, giving them a distressed vintage look. No assembly is required; the set comes as shown in images. *Extra crystal pendants and beads are included as replacement parts *Candles are not included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ec7iYIV-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMALFI DÉCOR","source_asin":"B07Q4ZY96Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q4ZY96Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q4ZY96Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
