window.products.push({"id":788533,"name":"NATUMAX Coccyx Seat Cushion, Chair Cushion with Non-Slip Removable Cover for Back Pain Tailbone and Sciatica Pain Relief for Home, Office and Car","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hpngt44iL._AC_.jpg","description":"NATUMAX Memory Foam Seat Cushion: The ergonomically designed contour shape of the pillow promotes healthy weight distribution, posture, proper spine alignment, and superior comfort. The design offers optimal support over long stretches of time.  -Butterfly Shape DESIGN Perfectly conforms to the exact shape of your buttocks -Middle Groove Curve Keeps your hipbones comfortable and reduces pressure on them.  - Arc Edge Design Alleiates the pressure of the thigh blood vessels effectively.  - W Shape Design Helps to correct sitting posture forming elegance. Can Help Relieve Pain From: - Back Pain & Sciatica - Coccyx / Tailbone - Sitting long hours - Spinal Alignment - Herniated Discs - Pregnancy  - Piriformis Syndrome Our seat cushion is made from premium memory foam, with a NO SLIP GRIP and a convenient handle to take it with you anywhere! Important Product Information: MEMORY FOAM IS HEAT & WEIGHT RESPONSIVE: Firmness for all memory foam products changes with temperature. Your cushion will feel softer in warm and firmer in cold temperatures. Room temperature is ideal for optimal performance. NATUMAX Coccyx Cushion will provide less support with increasing weight. OUR GUARANTEE: 30-Day MONEY BACK Guaranteed & 12-Month Warranty and friendly customer service. If you for any reason are not satisfaction by NATUMAX, please do not hesitate to contact us and We will do our best to solve your problem asap! Click The Yellow Add To Cart Button At The Top Of This Page And relieve your pain now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Hpngt44iL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NATUMAX","source_asin":"B07541L7WZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07541L7WZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07541L7WZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
