window.products.push({"id":788650,"name":"Kolka Vicuna Ochre 40% Alpaca-Wool Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j+0IIsyoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Composition: 30% Alpaca, 10% Wool, 60% Acrylic. Woven in Peru from the best quality Alpaca fiber sourced from farms throughout Peru. It is silky soft and light while also incredibly warm. This blanket/throw is ideal as an all-year round product, since it is light, but keeps you warm due to its air-storage balloons inside the hair, keeping hot air inside during cold days, and letting fresh, cold air inside during warmer days. Alpaca fiber is non-irritating and hypo-allergenic. Alpacas belong to the south American camel group, that live above 10,000 feet of altitude, and the changing temperatures and low oxygen help to develop a unique, durable, and soft natural hair, from which wonderful products are made. TAKING CARE OF ALPACA PRODUCTS: Dry cleaning is recommended, however, using cold water and shampoo is also possible. You can also use the wool program in your washing machine, and to dry, don't hang the products, since the natural fibers might expand, better place the product in a flat area to dry slowly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81j+0IIsyoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kolka","source_asin":"B009ZJ55CU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009ZJ55CU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009ZJ55CU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
