window.products.push({"id":788668,"name":"Cottify Bamboo Toothbrush Holder for Bathroom w/Cork Base, Toothbrush Cup with Drainage, Quick Drying Bathroom Cup Holder, Toothpaste Holder for Bathr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819xqiDygrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ FUNCTIONAL DESIGN: the main strength of Cottify toothbrush holder is how quickly it dries off. Is great at keeping air flow so no water collects for the items to sit in. Perfect for Bamboo Tooth Brush. Bathroom Toothbrush Holder has ventilation holes on all sides, including drainage at the bottom. That means 360˚ air circulation in all directions. Dry Bathroom Tumbler with Vents = Sanitary Toothbrush Storage = Healthy Household. Wood Toothbrush Holder or Toothbrush Drainer like no other. ✅ PREMIUM LOOK: crafted from single piece of bamboo wood each tooth brushing holder is unique. There are no 2 exactly the same. Available 2 designs are not only functional but will make any interior shine by its subtle, artistic and modern look. Each toothbrush holder cup with drainage holes is polished and carbonized for slightly darker tint and significantly improved water resistance. These toothbrush holders for bathroom have glossy finish and no engraved logo for even more elegant look. ✅ SAFE AND ECO FRIENDLY: Made from 100% MOSO Bamboo makes it fully biodegradable. This type of Bamboo grows very fast with little water, while Pandas do not like it. So by harvesting it we are not taking their natural habitat. Packaging is paper only. We also removed any background color and used single color print only to make it even more eco friendly toothbrush holder for bathroom. We are serious about sustainable approach to nature and the same applies also for our other product lines. ✅ MULTI-FUNCTIONAL: the ways to use our wooden toothbrush holder for bathroom are endless. It is perfect match to any toothbrushes, but it will work great also as Utensil Holder, Pen Holder or Pencil Holder. Fits perfectly to sustainable Bathroom, Kitchen, Office, Kid's room. Also known as shower toothbrush holder with holes in bottom, tooth brush holder, travel toothbrush case, farmhouse toothbrush holder for bathroom, bamboo makeup brush holder, toothbrush holder wood, bathroom storage cups. ⭐ SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We created our tooth brush holders for bathroom with passion and love. Passion for design and love for nature. And we hope you will love this wooden cup with drain too. However, if for any reason you won’t, no worries! Just send your Cottify toothbrush cup holder back our way for a full refund of the purchase price within the first 30 days. So look no more and give it a try. Cottify toothbrushes holder will be a perfect addition to your sustainable bathroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819xqiDygrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cottify","source_asin":"B09TGWH7CN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TGWH7CN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TGWH7CN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
