window.products.push({"id":788739,"name":"Air Purifiers for Bedroom Home Large Room, AMEIFU Hepa Air Purifier with Aromatherapy, H13 HEPA Air Filter Cleaner for Wildfires Smoke Pets Hair, Alle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tQCelir1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【TRUE HEPA AIR PURIFIER】 Filters out 99.97 percents of dust, pollen, mold spores, and pet dander. This air purifier filters particles as small as 0.3 microns and larger air pollution of PM 2.5, helping to improve overall health. Perfect for pet owners, babies, children, the elderly, or anyone wanting to improve the air quality in their home or hotel room. The perfect holiday, birthday, housewarming gift choice for parents, adult children, colleagues, and friends. 【QUIET OPERATION & 3 SPEED FAN】 Quietly cleans the air with less noise than a whisper on low 18 dB, and screen turns off automatically after one minute, relaxing to use as you sleep or work. Three fan speeds & auto-mode can be selected according to the actual need when use.(* The first or auto speed is recommended to use when sleeping.) 【PM2.5 SENDOR & 6 TIMER FUNCTION】 The air purifier automatically detects the indoor air condition and marked on the LED touch panel.Features 6 time function(2/4/6/8/10/12 hours) for your convenient use. The modern white finish help your air purifier fit anywhere in your home/bedroom/room. 【UNIQUE AROMATHERAPY DESIGN】 Struggling with musty smells? Add a few drops of your favorite fragrant essential oils (Not Included) to the aroma pad to keep your space smelling great.Note:The strength of the flavor depends on the flavor strength of the essential oil. 【TRUSTED & CERTIFIED】 Unlike the negative ion purifiers, this hepa air purifier is 100% no ozone with CE , FCC certification to ensure your safe use, which also meets the California Air Resources Board (CARB). We recommend replacing the filter every 3-6 months to ensure optimum performance. For any problem, just message us and we will make every effort to solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tQCelir1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMEIFU","source_asin":"B0C6TWG795","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6TWG795","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6TWG795","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
