window.products.push({"id":788766,"name":"Avenco Queen Mattress, Medium Firm Hybrid Mattress Queen, 10in Queen Mattresses in a Box with Gel-infused Memory Foam and Pocketed Spring, Motion Isoa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":292.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eto-BH3ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Avenco medium firm mattress queen in a box is mainly consisted with 2 parts which combine the contouring comfort layers of all-foam with the coil systems of traditional innersprings. For the contouring comfort layers of all-foam, this mattress hybrid queen size is divided into 4 layers. The toppest is the skin-friendly model knit fabric. Under the fabric is the cooling gel-infused memory foam. Then it will be comfortable foam. Another there will be high-density comfort foam. For the support part, there will be individually pocketed coils and stronger coils surrounding the edge the hybrid mattress cooling queen to avoid the sinking of the edge. 2. For the special structure of the spring mattress queen, this hybrid mattress cooling queen will be a balance of pressure relief, responsiveness, edge support, and temperature regulation. 3. This mattress hybrid queen size tends to walk the line between firmness and softness , which means hybrid mattress in a box queen will be well used as bunk bed mattress, day bed mattress, trundle bed mattress, RV mattress, or kids mattress. Also this medium firm queen mattress hybrid 10 inch will be friendly for all people, including pregnant and children. 4. Compared to general memory foam mattresses, hybrid mattresses more durable for their inner spring support. And compared to general innerspring mattresses, hybrid mattresses have a thicker comfort layer and have a top-to-bottom structure that keeps the mattress from being flippable. You may actually get more use out of them before it's time for a new mattress, but you have to be willing to spend a little more upfront.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eto-BH3ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avenco","source_asin":"B0BCXDGZHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCXDGZHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCXDGZHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
