window.products.push({"id":788989,"name":"Cobblestone Honey and Blue Woven Rag Rug in 100% Cotton, 2 x 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BllUFb3yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2' x 3' hand woven rag rug in honey with blue. The tight weave and color variations of fibers add a cobblestone pattern to this rug. You'll love these quality hand woven rag rugs! They wear like iron and are easy care. Just spot clean or hand wash in cold water. 100% cotton with fringe. Reversible to double their life. Enjoy these rag rugs in any room of your home! Due to heavy dye concentration and to prevent slipping, a rug pad is highly recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BllUFb3yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cobblestones","source_asin":"B00IWA8SQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-788989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IWA8SQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IWA8SQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
